<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Security — AI CallHub</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/favicon.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index-polish.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="overflow-x-hidden">
    <%- include("components/background") %>
    <%- include("components/navbar") %>

    <main class="relative z-10 pt-32 pb-24 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-32">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 lg:px-8">

            <div class="inline-block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-300 mb-4">Security</div>
            <h1 class="font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">How we protect your data</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-14 max-w-2xl">
                We take security seriously — not just in our words, but in our architecture and practices. Here's exactly how we keep your data safe.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-sm font-bold">1</span>
                        Encryption in transit
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Every connection between your browser and our servers uses <strong class="text-white">HTTPS/TLS</strong> — the same encryption used by online banks. Data is never sent in plaintext.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-sm font-bold">2</span>
                        Password hashing with bcrypt
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Your password is never stored in plaintext. We hash it with <strong class="text-white">bcrypt</strong> before saving — even our team can't see your password.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-sm font-bold">3</span>
                        Role-based access control
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Your calls, agents, transcripts, and knowledge base are scoped to your account. Only you (and teammates you explicitly add) can access them. We use signed JWT tokens to enforce this.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-sm font-bold">4</span>
                        Data storage
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Your data is stored in our managed cloud database (<strong class="text-white">MongoDB</strong>), which includes automated backups and encryption at rest. You can export your data anytime from the dashboard.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-sm font-bold">5</span>
                        Email security
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Verification and password-reset emails are sent via <strong class="text-white">Brevo</strong>, a compliant transactional email provider. Sensitive links expire after a short time.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg grid place-items-center bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold">!</span>
                        What's on our roadmap
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        We're working toward <strong class="text-white">SOC 2 Type II</strong> and <strong class="text-white">GDPR compliance</strong> certifications as the product scales. These are active priorities — not marketing claims. We'll update this page with audit reports once they're available.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-14 glass rounded-2xl p-7">
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Report a security issue</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    If you believe you've found a security vulnerability, please report it privately — <strong class="text-white">never</strong> open a public GitHub issue. Email <a href="mailto:toheedmalik321@gmail.com" class="text-teal-300 underline underline-offset-2">toheedmalik321@gmail.com</a> with details.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include("components/footer") %>
</body>
</html>